! BOUNDARY CONDITION CONTROL FILE (.TBC) controls the 2D boundary conditions and any 1D/2D boundary links

! RAINFALL BOUNDARIES
! Global Rainfall BC == <boundary_name>     ! e.g. of using global rainfall
! Read GIS RF == <path/to/2d_rf>            ! e.g. of using a vector layer to spatially distribute rainfall

! 1D/2D BOUNDARIES
! Read GIS BC == <path/to/2d_bc>            ! Links the 1D structures to the 2D domain
